    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Places To Go is a 2.5D retro puzzle adventure game where you travel through different places. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many levels!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are level trophies!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A level hub unlocks after you beat the game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creepy monsters and creatures!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of level types!</p></li></ul>",
